          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wamatshumi amathathu lesificaminwembili wokubusa kukaAsa inkosi yakoJuda uAhabi indodana kaOmri waba yinkosi koIsrayeli; wabusa koIsrayeli eSamariya iminyaka engamatshumi amabili lambili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza okubi phambi kweNkosi ukwedlula bonke ababekhona ngaphambi kwakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakungathi kakwanelanga kuye ukwenza izono zikaJerobowamu indodana kaNebati, wathatha uJezebeli indodakazi kaEthibali inkosi yaseSidoni ukuba abe ngumkakhe. Wakhonza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", wakhuleka kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamakhela ialtare ethempelini ayemakhele lona eSamariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhabi wamisela lonkulunkulukazi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " insika. Wenza okunengi okwayithukuthelisayo iNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli ukwedlula wonke amakhosi kaIsrayeli ayengaphambi kwakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensukwini zakhe uHiyeli waseBetheli wakha iJeriko; ekubekeni kwakhe izisekelo zalo walahlekelwa lizibulo lakhe uAbiramu, lasekumiseni kwakhe amasango alo walahlekelwa lithunjana lakhe uSegubi; kwagcwaliseka ilizwi leNkosi eyalikhuluma ngoJoshuwa indodana kaNuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
